The LedgerHashInput for attendance events: { institutionId, category: "attendance", type: "attendance.session_checkin", subjectUserId: studentId, payload, seq, prevEventHash }. Note actorUserId/deviceId undefined. Export a helper `attendanceHashInput`? The verifier needs to reconstruct exactly. Writer computes:

