I need to rewrite this properly. Let me restructure the whole thing cleanly:

- Anchor mode = predecessorRequired && predecessorHash === undefined (fresh anchor) OR fromSeq===0 (genesis assumed at first window row). In both cases skip the index-0 prevEventHash comparison.
- Linked mode = predecessorHash !== undefined: compare index 0 against predecessorHash.

